      "versionNonce": 59948608,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792761013208,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "never be deterministic but\nhow to make reproducible output (in some sense)\n\nIt is too late to make corrections when client see the final output.\n\nVery often the scattered outputs is caused by the query itself: if the query\nis not well defined and focused, there will be no well-defined output.\n\nA good way is to clarify right after client asks a question. Repharase the question\nin a way that:\n- client can easily verify\n- LLM can produce a more deterministic output",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "never be deterministic but\nhow to make reproducible output (in some sense)\n\nIt is too late to make corrections when client see the final output.\n\nVery often the scattered outputs is caused by the query itself: if the query\nis not well defined and focused, there will be no well-defined output.\n\nA good way is to clarify right after client asks a question. Repharase the question\nin a way that:\n- client can easily verify\n- LLM can produce a more deterministic output",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
